    "Tinytide backs up all babies and entries once a day and keeps the latest 10 on this iPhone. If something is changed or deleted by mistake, by you or anyone you share with, restore an earlier backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytide sichert einmal täglich alle Babys und Einträge und behält die letzten 10 Backups auf diesem iPhone. Wenn etwas versehentlich geändert oder gelöscht wurde – von dir oder jemandem, mit dem du teilst –, stelle ein früheres Backup wieder her."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytide backs up all babies and entries once a day and keeps the latest 10 on this iPhone. If something is changed or deleted by mistake, by you or anyone you share with, restore an earlier backup."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytide hace una copia de todos los bebés y registros una vez al día y guarda las 10 más recientes en este iPhone. Si tú o alguien con quien compartes cambia o borra algo por error, restaura una copia anterior."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytide sauvegarde tous les bébés et entrées une fois par jour et conserve les 10 dernières sauvegardes sur cet iPhone. Si quelque chose est modifié ou supprimé par erreur, par vous ou par une personne avec qui vous partagez, restaurez une sauvegarde antérieure."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytide は1日1回すべての赤ちゃんと記録をバックアップし、このiPhoneに最新10件を保存します。あなたや共有相手が誤って変更・削除したときは、以前のバックアップを復元できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytide는 하루에 한 번 모든 아기와 기록을 백업하고 이 iPhone에 최근 10개를 보관해요. 나 또는 공유한 사람이 실수로 바꾸거나 지웠다면 이전 백업으로 복원하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Tinytide faz backup de todos os bebês e registros uma vez por dia e mantém os 10 mais recentes neste iPhone. Se algo for alterado ou apagado por engano, por você ou por alguém com quem você compartilha, restaure um backup anterior."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytide 每天备份一次所有宝宝和记录，并在这台 iPhone 上保留最近 10 份。如果你或共享的家人误改、误删了内容，可以恢复到之前的备份。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytide 每天備份一次所有寶寶和記錄，並在這台 iPhone 上保留最近 10 份。如果你或共享的家人誤改、誤刪了內容，可以還原到之前的備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinytide is an independent app with no ads and no tracking. If it has made your nights a little easier, a tip helps keep it going.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytide ist eine unabhängige App ohne Werbung und ohne Tracking. Wenn sie deine Nächte ein bisschen leichter gemacht hat, hilft ein Trinkgeld, damit es weitergeht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytide is an independent app with no ads and no tracking. If it has made your nights a little easier, a tip helps keep it going."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytide es una app independiente, sin anuncios ni rastreo. Si te ha hecho las noches un poco más fáciles, una propina ayuda a que siga adelante."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytide est une app indépendante, sans publicité ni pistage. Si elle a rendu vos nuits un peu plus douces, un pourboire l’aide à continuer."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytideは広告もトラッキングもない、個人開発のAppです。夜が少しでもラクになったと感じていただけたら、チップで応援していただけるとうれしいです。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinytide는 광고도 추적도 없는 독립 앱이에요. 밤이 조금이라도 편해지셨다면, 팁으로 Tinytide가 계속될 수 있도록 도와주세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Tinytide é um app independente, sem anúncios e sem rastreamento. Se ele deixou suas noites um pouco mais fáceis, uma gorjeta ajuda a mantê-lo funcionando."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "摇摇是一款独立开发的 App，没有广告，也不追踪你。如果它让你的夜晚轻松了一点，欢迎打赏支持它继续走下去。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "搖搖是一款獨立開發的 App，沒有廣告，也不會追蹤你。如果它讓你的夜晚輕鬆了一點，歡迎小額贊助，支持它繼續走下去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tips are not available right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trinkgeld ist gerade nicht verfügbar."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tips are not available right now."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las propinas no están disponibles en este momento."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les pourboires ne sont pas disponibles pour le moment."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在チップはご利用いただけません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "지금은 팁을 보낼 수 없어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As gorjetas não estão disponíveis no momento."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂时无法打赏。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前無法進行小額贊助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tips are optional one-time purchases. They don't unlock anything: every feature stays free for everyone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trinkgelder sind freiwillige Einmalkäufe. Sie schalten nichts frei: Alle Funktionen bleiben für alle kostenlos."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tips are optional one-time purchases. They don't unlock anything: every feature stays free for everyone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las propinas son compras únicas y opcionales. No desbloquean nada: todas las funciones siguen siendo gratis para todos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les pourboires sont des achats uniques et facultatifs. Ils ne débloquent rien : toutes les fonctions restent gratuites pour tous."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "チップは任意の1回限りの購入です。チップで解除される機能はなく、すべての機能はどなたでも無料でお使いいただけます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "팁은 선택 사항인 일회성 구입이에요. 잠금 해제되는 기능은 없으며, 모든 기능은 누구에게나 계속 무료예요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As gorjetas são compras únicas e opcionais. Elas não desbloqueiam nada: todos os recursos continuam gratuitos para todos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打赏是自愿的一次性购买，不会解锁任何内容：所有功能对所有人都免费。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小額贊助是自由選擇的單次購買，不會解鎖任何內容：所有功能都對所有人免費。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
