    "Your support means a lot. It goes straight into making Tinytide better for every tired parent out there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Unterstützung bedeutet uns viel. Sie fließt direkt in ein besseres Tinytide für alle müden Eltern da draußen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your support means a lot. It goes straight into making Tinytide better for every tired parent out there."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu apoyo significa mucho. Va directo a mejorar Tinytide para todas las madres y padres cansados."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre soutien compte beaucoup. Il sert directement à améliorer Tinytide pour tous les parents fatigués."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "応援が大きな励みになります。いただいたご支援は、毎日がんばるすべてのパパ・ママのためにTinytideをより良くすることに直接使われます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "보내 주신 응원은 정말 큰 힘이 돼요. 지친 모든 부모님을 위해 Tinytide를 더 좋게 만드는 데 바로 쓰여요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu apoio significa muito. Ele vai direto para deixar o Tinytide melhor para todos os pais e mães cansados por aí."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的支持意义重大，它会直接用来把摇摇做得更好，帮到每一位疲惫的爸爸妈妈。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的支持對我們意義重大，它會直接用來讓搖搖變得更好，幫助每一位辛苦的爸爸媽媽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tip is waiting for approval. Thank you!": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Trinkgeld wartet auf Genehmigung. Danke!"
